        "Description": "Keith McKenzie is an unscrupulous lawyer who has already been making his career getting innocent people jailed for murder. He&apos;s now aiming to join Ken Morgan&apos;s firm, where he will do considerably more damage. The family of one of his victims, who died in jail, want him dealt with.\r\rMcKenzie is spending the afternoon in a highly public area. It may be difficult to terminate him without getting caught. But if anyone can do it...\r\rGood luck, 47.",
